# Deployment configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file shows what GitHub Actions variables you need to set.
# Do NOT set these here — set them in your GitHub repo settings:
#   GitHub repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables tab
#
# Variable name : CUSTOM_DOMAIN
# Current value : costoflivinguae.unni.live
# Future value  : costoflivinguae.xyz
#
# To update the domain:
#   1. Go to GitHub repo → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#   2. Click the "Variables" tab
#   3. Edit CUSTOM_DOMAIN to the new domain
#   4. Re-run the workflow (or push a commit to main)
#   5. Update your DNS CNAME record to point to: your-username.github.io
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

CUSTOM_DOMAIN=costoflivinguae.unni.live
